{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026dgf5rLNslL1792772961.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一連三天的第一屆全球治理論壇，在河北雄安新區舉辦。</p><p></p><p>活動由中國人民外交學會主辦，中共中央政治局委員、外長王毅、河北省委書記羅文出席開幕式。王毅表示，世界要走向多極化，國際關係實現民主化是時代潮流，應當以更主動的擔當，把全球治理倡議謀劃的藍圖一步步推向前進。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.HB.FORUM 2000.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026X3NZry2vyi1792759572.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>論壇有來自90多個國家的180多名專家、學者和政界人士等人參與，中方嘉賓亦有約180人。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T17:44:28.904745+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T11:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T23:58:23.134067+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T17:38:12.791955+00:00","content_hash":"eadc4eb689c159acfb7b8a0a620e116cf9530cb167e3fe7452fc038685c98e91","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T17:44:28.904745+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}